{
 "id": "create:fan/processing",
 "schematic": "fan/processing",
 "schematicNamespace": "create",
 "title": "Processing Items using Encased Fans",
 "texts": {
  "text_1": "When passing through lava, the Air Flow becomes Heated",
  "text_2": "Items caught in the area will be smelted",
  "text_3": "Food items thrown here would be incinerated",
  "text_4": "Instead, a setup for Smoking using Fire should be used for them",
  "text_5": "Air Flows passing through water create a Washing Setup",
  "text_6": "Some interesting new processing can be done with it",
  "text_7": "The Speed of the Fan does NOT affect the processing speed, only its range",
  "text_8": "Fan Processing can also be applied to Items on Depots and Belts"
 },
